WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.650
Every day, we're flooded with information
Articles, videos, all fighting for our attention

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:19.820
[News cacophony]

00:00:21.400 -->  00:00:23.400
Papa please allow me to get the vaccine

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.000
All my friends at school got it

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.120
YOU'RE NOT GETTING VAXXED, NO ONE WILL

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.220
No one will

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.630
But not all information is created equal

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:47.950
Some of it is wrong, some of it is deceptive,
some of it is dangerous

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.210
Is this really true? let's checkout Credleaf

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.000
[Speech — transcription needed]

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:16.600
[Pastes article link into Credleaf]

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.600
[Credleaf gives the article
a credibility score of 3.6%]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.100
Papa I want to get the HTV vaccine at school

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.100
We'll go tomorrow

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.100
All my friends said they got one

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.100
Don't worry you'll get one as well

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.100
Thank you papa
